        "README.md": "Harbor logistics — A workspace document buffer persists independently of the current view badge. Save callbacks can synchronously navigate. Preview is transient and owns a different quiet interval. Document-buffer responsibility: store-owned BufferBank\n",
        "VISIBLE_CHECKS.md": "Public checks are deterministic external examples, not hidden gold. They are executed after each submitted Action. Keep original task/source obligations. Checks: latest quiet burst (120ms), persistence before departure returns, synchronous save callback navigation stays authoritative, preview hide discards pending work and allows reuse.\nUse the declared runtime: go Go 1.13.8. The external adapter is not mounted in the model workspace; do not access scorer/reference files. Build temporary artifacts in /tmp.\n",
        "dependencies.lock.json": "{\n  \"runtime\": \"Go 1.13.8\",\n  \"package_lock_sha256\": \"2c97d9cb5a20bf562827046c5678cf98b4fccced4c7f0dd120688db9c811dc59\",\n  \"native_standard_library\": true,\n  \"cache\": \"results/student-case-expansion-runtime\"\n}\n",
        "docs/host-api.md": "createWorkspace offers open(id), edit(text), close(), dispose(); createSearchPreview offers query(text), hide(). Store read/write/subscribe is synchronous; timer schedule(callback,delay), cancel(handle) is explicitly controlled. Document buffers are owned by the store BufferBank, while Badge owns only a live subscription. A store listener may call navigation synchronously. All source identities/text and status payloads retain original semantics.\n",
        "package-lock.json": "{\n  \"lockfileVersion\": 3,\n  \"requires\": true,\n  \"packages\": {\n    \"\": {}\n  }\n}\n",
